@voice oduya
// Writer (command: senior officers), wave 1b. Ship's Counsellor; warm, perceptive, unhurried; the bowl of sweets.
//
// HOW THEY TALK: Unhurried and warm, long gentle sentences. Asks good questions and lets the silence do the work. Notices things and says so kindly. Never says "how does that make you feel".
// WITH JUNIORS: makes them feel they have all the time in the world.
// MOOD TELLS: when he's tired he asks fewer questions and offers more sweets.
tpl: warm
